[6.0455, "o", "\u001b[1;31m  ✗ \u001b[0m\u001b[2mdata/train.jsonl:1450 \u001b[0m\u001b[36m[tool-calls] \u001b[0mMessage 1, call 0: function name is not declared in tools\r\n"]
